数据链路打通\n参与具身智能数据平台建设，包括数据检索、Episode管理、数据回放、质量监控和数据分析等能力开发，推动机器人数据闭环建设\n与算法、机器人研发及应用团队协作，建立\"数据采集—数据治理—模型训练—效果评估—数据优化\"的闭环流程，支撑机器人智能化能力提升\n","Require":"任职要求\n本科及以上学历，计算机、自动化、机器人、人工智能、软件工程等相关专业\n熟练掌握Python，具备较强的软件开发和工程实现能力，能够独立完成数据处理工具、自动化脚本及系统模块开发\n具备数据处理、数据清洗、数据分析或数据平台开发经验，熟悉NumPy、Pandas、OpenCV、PyTorch Dataset等相关工具\n理解机器人多模态数据，包括RGB/RGB-D、机器人状态、关节数据、末端位姿、动作轨迹、时间同步等\n加分项\n熟悉ROS/ROS2、rosbag/MCAP等机器人数据格式与工具链\n有真实机器人平台（UR/Franka/Unitree/自研）数据采集或开发经验\n了解遥操作、动捕等数据采集方案，有数据闭环建设经验\n有前端开发能力（Vue/React），能独立完成数据平台界面开发","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-10T09:59:34","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"f448efa6-3e8f-4775-939b-092d3329fa48","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390872185,"PostDateInt":1791597519000,"PostDate":"2026-10-10T09:58:39","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"软件工程师","OrgId":1110424,"Org":"控制软件团队","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责x86与ARM Linux环境下机器人控制系统软件的功能开发与维护； \n2. 与前端工作开发人员配合，开发用户接口模块；\n3. 与算法工程师配合，完成已验证算法的产品化实现；\n4. 与供应商配合，完成ARM Linux下uboot、内核、驱动、文件系统的开发与裁剪\n5. 负责开发文档的编写、功能模块调试、单元测试编写与研发测试工作，并参与机器人的软件评审与集成部署等工作","Require":"1. 3年以上机器人、机床、运动控制器等工业自动化控制产品软件开发经验，本科以上学历\n2. 熟悉Linux环境下C/C++、python、cmake、git等工具\n3. 有以下任意两个方向经验：\n    a. 熟悉ARM平台（如RK、TI）下的应用软件的开发调试，了解基本的uboot、Linux内核与驱动开发与裁剪，对实时Linux及其实时性程序开发有一定了解\n    b. 熟悉常见的工业总线，如何EtherCAT、CanOpen、Profinet、Modbus等\n    c. 熟悉ros2平台下的机器人系统的开发，包括但不限于，熟练掌握moveit、nav、roscontrol等组件中的一个或多个\n4. 熟悉Scrum、TDD等开发方法，熟悉常用的软件设计模式\n5. 较强的沟通能力、钻研精神及良好的团队协作意识，且具有较强的学习能力和问题分析处理能力","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-10T09:58:39","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDuty